OL,3,GNEWSAThe pub crawl that has just hit
OL,4,Aits 25,000th inn
OL,5,
OL,6,FA team that has spent 42 years on one
OL,7,Fof the world's longest pub crawls has
OL,8,Fmarked its 25,000th inn.
OL,10,FThe Black Country Ale Tairsters have
OL,11,Fspent decades travelling across the UK
OL,12,Fand beyond, but marked their latest
OL,13,Fmilestone at The Old Royal Library in
OL,14,FGreat Malvern, Worcestershire.
OL,16,FThe West Bromwich-based team had
OL,17,Finitially planned to visit just 250
OL,18,Fpubs for charity, based on a map issued
OL,19,Fby a Wolverhampton brewer.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
