OL,3,GNEWSAThe pub crawl that has just hit
OL,4,Aits 25,000th inn
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It started off with my dad," said
OL,7,FPeter Hill, one of the groups founding
OL,8,Fmembers. "He put this map up with 250
OL,9,FBanks' pubs on and we said we'd visit
OL,10,Fall of them for charity in 1984 and
OL,11,Fit's all carried on from there."
